  <body>
   <p><date when="1861-01-22">22</date> 
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00000258">He</persName> appointed the following Notaries Public for the counties named, to wit: <persName ref="cwgk:N00002299">L. H. Roussean</persName>, <persName ref="cwgk:N00002300">Rob<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">t</hi></hi> A Watts</persName> and <persName ref="cwgk:N00001250">John B. Bell</persName> of <placeName ref="cwgk:P001005">Jefferson County</placeName>.</p>
<p>He approved an account of $9.<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">55</hi></hi> to <persName ref="cwgk:N00020989">W. A Gale</persName> for work done at State House certified by the <persName ref="cwgk:N00001596">Librarian</persName> as correct</p>
<p>Also approved Warrant in favor of <persName ref="cwgk:N00000466">Grant Green</persName> Auditor of $833.<hi rend="sup">35</hi>/<hi rend="sub">100</hi> for salary</p>
<p>He accepted and caused to be filed the resignation of <persName ref="cwgk:N00002298">I. T. Elliston</persName> a Justice of the Peace for <placeName ref="cwgk:P00000938">Grant County</placeName> in district N<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">o</hi></hi> 4.</p>
<p>He commissioned <persName ref="cwgk:N00001078">R. S. Barrow</persName> Police Judge of the town of <placeName ref="cwgk:P00001061">Somerset</placeName>, duly elected<pb/></p>
<p><note place="header">164</note></p>
<p><date when="1861">1861</date> Executive Journal</p>
<p><date when="1861-01-22">Jany 22<hi rend="sup">d</hi></date> 
<lb/>The Governor appointed the following Justices of the Peace, to wit:</p>
<p><table rend="rules">
<row>
	<cell><placeName ref="cwgk:P001013">Shelby County</placeName></cell>
	<cell>Dist N<hi rend="sup">o</hi> 4</cell>
	<cell><persName ref="cwgk:N00002292">I E Sodowsky</persName> vice <persName ref="cwgk:N00008306">S. W. Crawford</persName></cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><placeName ref="cwgk:P00002312">Webster "</placeName></cell>
	<cell>" "</cell>
	<cell><persName ref="cwgk:N00018271">W. H. Winstead</persName> " <persName ref="cwgk:N00016297">S. T. Morrow</persName></cell>
</row>
</table></p>
<p>He respited for twelve months the following Judgments</p>
<p><table rend="rules">
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000428">Marshall E &amp; C. Ct</orgName>. vs <persName ref="cwgk:N00021366">W<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">m</hi></hi> Clark</persName>.</cell>
	<cell>$20. -- </cell>
	<cell>Selling liquor</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000409">Johnson Cir "</orgName> " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021369">Dan<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">l</hi></hi> Ramey</persName></cell>
	<cell>$20.</cell>
	<cell>" "</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000387">Green " "</orgName> " <persName ref="cwgk:N00019315">I. D. Williams</persName></cell>
	<cell>$60.</cell>
	<cell>Tipling</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000358">Bath " "</orgName> " <persName ref="cwgk:N00009395">Lightfoot</persName> &amp; <persName ref="cwgk:N00021375">Crane</persName></cell>
	<cell>$60.</cell>
	<cell>"</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000374">Edmunsen E &amp; C "</orgName> " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021376">Silas Johnson</persName></cell>
	<cell>$60</cell>
	<cell>"</cell>
</row>
</table></p>
<p>He remitted the following Judgments, to wit:</p>
<p><table rend="rules">
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000576">Scott Cir. Ct</orgName> vs <persName ref="cwgk:N00021377">D. Allsop</persName></cell>
	<cell>$20</cell>
	<cell>Gaming</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000417">Lincoln " "</orgName> " <persName ref="cwgk:N00020310">S. Engleman</persName></cell>
	<cell>$50.</cell>
	<cell>Concealed Weapons</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000434">Morgan " "</orgName> " <persName ref="cwgk:N00008946">W. W. Cox</persName></cell>
	<cell>$20. -- </cell>
	<cell>Misdemeanor</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000418">Lawrence " "</orgName> " <persName ref="cwgk:N00020372">Jesse Meek</persName> &amp; others</cell>
	<cell>$20 each -- </cell>
	<cell>gaming</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000373">Daviess " "</orgName> " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021378">David Owen</persName></cell>
	<cell>$75.</cell>
	<cell>Assault.</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell>Johnson " " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021387">Rich<hi rend="sup">d</hi> Meek</persName></cell>
	<cell>$50.</cell>
	<cell>Concealed Weapons</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000424">Mercer " "</orgName> " <persName ref="cwgk:N00003677">Theo. H. Daviess</persName> -- </cell>
	<cell>two Judgt<hi rend="sup">s</hi> $25. &amp; $30.</cell>
	<cell> </cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000418">Lawrence " "</orgName> " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021383">C. Marcum</persName></cell>
	<cell>$50.</cell>
	<cell>Misdemeanor</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000410">Kenton " "</orgName> " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021390">O. H. Thompson</persName></cell>
	<cell>$50</cell>
	<cell>Illegal Voting</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell>Scott " " " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021381">J. Stokeley</persName></cell>
	<cell>$30.</cell>
	<cell>Assault</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000371">Calloway E &amp; C. "</orgName> " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021391">J. P. Starks</persName> </cell>
	<cell>$28 <hi rend="sup">50</hi>/<hi rend="sub">100</hi></cell>
	<cell>breach of the peace</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000677">Pulaski J. P. "</orgName> " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021394">R. Pierce</persName></cell>
	<cell>$15.</cell>
	<cell>" "</cell>
</row>
<row>
	<cell><orgName ref="cwgk:O00000661">Mason " "</orgName> " <persName ref="cwgk:N00021386">Jo<hi rend="underline"><hi rend="sup">s</hi></hi> T. Forman</persName></cell>
	<cell>$20</cell>
	<cell>" "</cell>
</row>
</table></p>
<p>He remitted to <persName ref="cwgk:N00020376">Bernard Begley</persName> and L. H. Rousseau -- a forfeiture of recognizance for $600. in the <orgName ref="cwgk:O001000">Jefferson Circuit Court</orgName>.</p>
